###Block: Descriptions
Antifire Sphere.MOD	DESC:See text.
Ashen Union.MOD	DESC:Deal (min((CASTERLEVEL+1)/2,5))d6.
Ashtar.MOD	DESC:Creates an ashtar under your control.
Awaken Sand.MOD	DESC:Create sentient sand friendly to you.
Black Sand.MOD	DESC:Take 1d4 damage each round in area.
Blast of Sand.MOD	DESC:Deals (min(CASTERLEVEL,10))d6 of damage to all in area.
Body Blaze.MOD	DESC:Leave a trail of flame; any who cross the trail take 2d6+(min(CASTERLEVEL,20)).
Choking Sands.MOD	DESC:Target can take full round action (Fort save) to expel dust, otherwise a Con check to avoid suffocation.
Cloak of Shade.MOD	DESC:Protects target from normal heat exposure.
Control Sand.MOD	DESC:Spell not completed.
Desert Binding.MOD	DESC:Acts as binding from PHB 204; see text.
Desert Diverson.MOD	DESC:Disrupts planar travel; see text.
Desiccate.MOD	DESC:Deal (min((CASTERLEVEL+1)/2,5))d6 dessication damage; plants and water elementals take d8 and earth element takes d4.
Desiccate (Mass).MOD	DESC:Deal (min((CASTERLEVEL+1)/2,5))d6 dessication damage; plants and water elementals take d8 and earth element takes d4.
Dispel Water.MOD	DESC:You can counter &amp; dismiss water creatures, spells, and effects; see text.
Flashflood.MOD	DESC:Creates a roaring, frothing wall of water; see text.
Flaywind Burst.MOD	DESC:Read text.
Flesh to Salt (Mass).MOD	DESC:(min(CASTERLEVEL,20)/4) targets takes (min(CASTERLEVEL,20)/2)d6 damage, if it takes more than half it's current HP save or become salt.
Freedom of Breath.MOD	DESC:Protects against suffocation in adverse conditions.
Fuse Sand.MOD	DESC:See text.
Halo of Sand.MOD	DESC:Deflection bonus to AC +(min(CASTERLEVEL/3),4).
Hydrate.MOD	DESC:Heals 2d8+(min(CASTERLEVEL,10)) of dessication damage; on fire creatures it inflicts the same.
Impede Sun's Brilliance.MOD	DESC:Drops temperature by 20 degrees in a stationary area.
Mantle of the Fiery Spirit.MOD	DESC:Permanently grants the fire subtype.
Mephit Mob.MOD	DESC:Summons 2d6 mephits.
Parboil.MOD	DESC:Deal 6d6 fire damage and 2d4 intelligence damage. Save takes half damage and no intelligence loss.
Parching Touch.MOD	DESC:Deal 1d6 dessication damage. Save or become dehydrated and lose 1 constitution point.
Protection from Dessication.MOD	DESC:Warded creature immune to dehydration until the spell has absorbed (min(CASTERLEVEL,10)*10) damage.
Sandform.MOD	DESC:You become an ooze with most immunities except to mind-affect; see text.
Sandstorm.MOD	DESC:Create sandstorm; see text.
Scalding Mud.MOD	DESC:Like trasmute rock to mud.
Scimitar of Sand.MOD	DESC:Deal 1d6+(min(CASTERLEVEL,20)/2) plus they must save or become dehydrated.
Searing Exposure.MOD	DESC:Save or take (min(CASTERLEVEL,15))d4 nonlethal heat exposure damage; see text.
Skin of the Cactus.MOD	DESC:Grants +3 enhancement bonus to natural armor. Increases to +4 @ 10th level &amp; +5 @ 13th level (min(CASTERLEVEL,15)/3).
Sleep mote.MOD	DESC:Creates dust devil of slumber-inducing particles; see text.
Slipsand.MOD	DESC:Turns natural sand into a deadly pit of slipsand.
Soul of the Waste.MOD	DESC:You meld your body and 100 lbs of possesions into the sand.
Storm Mote.MOD	DESC:Deals 2d8 to creatures caught in the vortex you control.
Summon Desert Ally I.MOD	DESC:Create a dustform creature (pg.161); see text.
Summon Desert Ally II.MOD	DESC:Create a dustform creature (pg.161); see text.
Summon Desert Ally III.MOD	DESC:Create a dustform creature (pg.161); see text.
Summon Desert Ally IV.MOD	DESC:Create a dustform creature (pg.161); see text.
Summon Desert Ally V.MOD	DESC:Create a dustform creature (pg.161); see text.
Summon Desert Ally VI.MOD	DESC:Create a dustform creature (pg.161); see text.
Summon Desert Ally VII.MOD	DESC:Create a dustform creature (pg.161); see text.
Summon Desert Ally VIII.MOD	DESC:Create a dustform creature (pg.161); see text.
Summon Desert Ally IX.MOD	DESC:Create a dustform creature (pg.161); see text.
Symbol of Thirst.MOD	DESC:Like symbol of death, only all subjects are consumed with a terrible thirst.
Tormenting Thirst.MOD	DESC:Must drink, consumed with thoughts to drink.
Transmute Sand to Glass.MOD	DESC:Turns sand into solid glass.
Transmute Stone to Sand.MOD	DESC:Turns stone into sand.
Unearthly Heat.MOD	DESC:Each round subject take 1d6 lethal and 1d4 nonlethal damage. Save negates the damage for the round.
Vitrify.MOD	DESC:Turns sand into crude glass.
Vitrify.MOD	DESC:Spell not completed.
Wall of Magma.MOD	DESC:Create a wall of thick magma.
Wall of Salt.MOD	DESC:Creates a solid wall of salt crystal.
Waste Strider.MOD	DESC:Unrestricted desert movement.
Whispering Sand.MOD	DESC:Communicate over long distances in the desert.
Wither.MOD	DESC:Creature takes (min(CASTERLEVEL,10))d6 dessication damage and is dehydrated.
Mephit Mob (Thirst Domain).MOD	DESC:Dust, salt, or sulfur mephits only.
Mephit Mob (Thirst Domain).MOD	DESC: Summons 2d6 mephits.
